# =============================================================================
#  Private Wealth Management Ontology (PWM), version 0.4 (draft)
#
#  A generic ontology for private banking and wealth management, built on
#  published standards (FIBO, OMG Commons, W3C PROV-O, SKOS, DPV) and grounded
#  in regulation and in the Kognita governed-agent roadmap.
#
#  Author: Ahmed Muzammil (https://ahmedmuzammil.com)
#  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
#
#  How to read the references: every PWM term carries one or more
#  pwm:citation nodes. Each names a reference in the register (pwmref:...) and
#  a locator inside it (article, paragraph, roadmap item). Alignments to FIBO,
#  OMG Commons, PROV-O and DPV are expressed as rdfs:subClassOf or
#  skos:exactMatch / skos:closeMatch, and are not repeated as citations.
#
#  This file does not owl:import FIBO or OMG Commons. External terms are
#  declared with rdfs:isDefinedBy pointing at their source ontology, so the
#  file loads on its own; import FIBO alongside it to reason over FIBO axioms.
# =============================================================================

@prefix rdf:      <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs:     <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd:      <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix skos:     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms:  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix vann:     <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/> .
@prefix prov:     <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix dpv:      <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
@prefix ai:       <https://w3id.org/dpv/ai#> .

@prefix cmns-pts:   <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/PartiesAndSituations/> .
@prefix cmns-org:   <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Organizations/> .
@prefix cmns-rga:   <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/RegulatoryAgencies/> .
@prefix cmns-bauth: <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/BusinessAuthorizations/> .
@prefix cmns-rlcmp: <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/RolesAndCompositions/> .
@prefix cmns-doc:   <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/Documents/> .

